  "description": "Jungle Vibe is a fresh and energetic fragrance that blends green citrus freshness with aromatic herbs and smooth woody depth. The scent feels vibrant, adventurous, and masculine while maintaining a clean modern versatility that works effortlessly for daily wear. The opening introduces bergamot, lemon, and green notes, creating a crisp citrus freshness with an invigorating natural character. The heart develops into lavender, herbs, and aromatic accords, adding smooth masculine freshness balanced by subtle earthy depth. The base settles into cedarwood, vetiver, amber, and musk, leaving a fresh woody trail that feels clean, smooth, and long-lasting. Jungle Vibe is perfect for men who enjoy green fresh fragrances with woody aromatic warmth and an energetic outdoors-inspired character.",
